tweets.text:
One loss is one too many.
 
@DFOBaltimore created a powerful video in hopes that those deliberating suicide, realize that they are loved. Anyone can connect to trained counselor by calling or texting 988.
 
#SuicidePrevention #SuicideAwarenessMonth

